OL,3,GNEWSADrivers urged to be alert during
OL,4,Adeer rutting season
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers in the Sussex have been warned
OL,7,Fto be extra cautious about the risk of
OL,8,Fcollisions with deer during the rutting
OL,9,Fseason.
OL,11,FAccording to the British Deer Society
OL,12,F(BDS), more deer can appear on the
OL,13,Froads during the fallow deer rutting
OL,14,Fseason, which runs from late September
OL,15,Fto early November, with October the
OL,16,Fpeak month of activity.
OL,18,FThe East Sussex Deer Warden said that
OL,19,Fthe risk of "striking a deer rises
OL,20,Fexponentially" with less sunlight.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
