OL,3,GNEWSADrivers urged to be alert during
OL,4,Adeer rutting season
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshdown Forest, meanwhile, said that
OL,7,F"deer movement can happen at any time
OL,8,Fof day", not just during the morning
OL,9,Fand evening rush hours.
